.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-remote-owners 1  "geectl-remote-owners 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-owners \- Show the owners of a package (project/package scope)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote owners\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the owners of a package (project/package scope)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show each person as `login (realname <email>)`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package to show the owners of
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
